# Local scratch output -- smoke-test dumps, route listings, anything written just to eyeball
# once. A pair of these (_api_paths.txt, _smoke_results.txt) reached a commit by accident, and
# one carried a live Supabase refresh token in its captured response body. The leading
# underscore is the convention for "scratch, never commit".
/_*.txt
/_*.json
